WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.857
[Original electronic music]
Colored petals open around a ring of stars.

00:00:06.857 --> 00:00:13.714
The ring expands and reforms in time
with the score inside a teal panorama.

00:00:13.714 --> 00:00:20.567
Three robot films play beneath the floating
timeline as the viewpoint moves forward.
